<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Dispute #{{disputeId}} of swap <a href="https://app.fiatx
.co/swap/{{orderId}}">#{{orderId}}</a> has passed the evidence phase.
This means new evidence(s) will not be accepted. It is now time for the <b>vote
  commit phase</b>. <br><br> In this phase, drafted mediators will commit their
vote
to either release the asset or cancel the swap.
<br><br>
Vote Commit Phase Ends In: <b style="font-size:
22px; color: darkolivegreen;">{{commitPhaseHoursLeft}}</b>
<br>
{{#if drafted}}
  <h3 style="color: indianred">WARNING</h3>
  <ul style="color: indianred">
    <li>Carefully review the evidences and commit your vote.</li>
    <li>Missing the vote commit phase will get your ticket slashed.</li>
    <li>Committing a vote that ends up among the minority voters will get your
      ticket slashed.
    </li>
  </ul>
{{/if}}
<br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">How Disputes Work</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
